+    "llm.tokens_prompt is a CUMULATIVE SUM over responses (+= prompt_n per response, arc_scored_path_lever_harness.py:267), not a single request's prompt size. The cd82/b2000 cell made 11 responses, so its per-request mean is ~1472 tokens.",
